1
00:00:43,242 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 24=

3
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,202
Ye Shen.

4
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,520
Trying to run?

5
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,481
Ye Shen.

6
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,160
- Ye Shen!
- Run!

7
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,480
Leave me!

8
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:04,960
Leave me! Run!

9
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,280
Xiaotang! Ye Shen!

10
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,280
- Freeze!
- They're over there!

11
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,298
- Don't run!
- Don't move!

12
00:01:16,298 --> 00:01:17,356
Stop right there!

13
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:19,000
- Get down! Get down!
- Stop!

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,135
- Stop!
- Stop!

15
00:01:20,135 --> 00:01:21,759
- Stop!
- I'll call an ambulance!

16
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:34,862
(Why?)

17
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,250
(Why am I always one step away
from perfection?)

18
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,047
You're doing this again.

19
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,880
Get up.

20
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,200
Didn't I tell you

21
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,360
to protect yourself?

22
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,036
You rushed in front again.

23
00:01:55,008 --> 00:01:56,480
My heart goes to waste.

24
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,086
Forget it.

25
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,520
I'll join you one more time.

26
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,983
What are you doing?

27
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,565
Xiaotang,

28
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,200
don't you think

29
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,747
this ending

30
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,996
is already perfect?

31
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,040
That's nonsense.

32
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,520
You always said

33
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,999
you went through so many loops

34
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,920
just to have a perfect ending,

35
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,960
and you failed every time.

36
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,840
But I think

37
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,760
this ending

38
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:43,760
is perfect.

39
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,127
No.

40
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:48,880
Without you,
how could my life ever be perfect?

41
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:49,921
- Don't waste time.
- No.

42
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,840
You cannot die.

43
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,564
If you die,

44
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,520
what will happen

45
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,400
to the people who love you?

46
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,760
Your mom

47
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:07,800
will lose a wonderful daughter.

48
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,659
Xia Na

49
00:03:12,332 --> 00:03:14,360
will lose her best friend.

50
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,053
Ms. Lei and the others

51
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:24,160
will lose someone
they cherish like a sister.

52
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,212
You cannot die.

53
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,239
Then

54
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:40,761
what about you?

55
00:03:40,761 --> 00:03:41,873
Xiaotang,

56
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,560
you always asked me

57
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,520
what my regret was.

58
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,200
My regret

59
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,858
has always been you.

60
00:04:05,513 --> 00:04:06,625
Xiaotang,

61
00:04:09,361 --> 00:04:10,760
I love you.

62
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:15,920
Now

63
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:18,776
I have no regrets.

64
00:04:19,204 --> 00:04:26,162
♪Just see him
as a passerby in your life♪

65
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,760
Ye Shen!

66
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,467
Ye Shen!

67
00:04:35,994 --> 00:04:42,032
♪I have found
the moonlight in my dreams♪

68
00:04:47,857 --> 00:04:49,514
(Lu Qingyuan, Li Kaixuan,
and others are arrested)

69
00:04:49,514 --> 00:04:50,721
(for kidnapping and assault)

70
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:03,792
(One week later)

71
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,305
(Gu Xiaotang.)

72
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:52,080
Lu Qingyuan's and Director Li's charges
have been confirmed.

73
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,333
They probably will rot in jail.

74
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,600
Ms. Lei is cleared of all charges.

75
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,760
She wasn't part of the warehouse thing.

76
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:00,147
They let her go with a warning.

77
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,219
That's good.

78
00:06:05,235 --> 00:06:06,320
Xiaotang,

79
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:09,640
in those loops you talked about,

80
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,662
was I really that awful?

81
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,431
It doesn't matter anymore.

82
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,600
Right now, you're still my best friend.

83
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,171
That's all that matters.

84
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,379
Xiaotang,

85
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,080
I was thinking

86
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,640
that maybe the loops

87
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:33,080
weren't meant for you
to create an absolutely flawless,

88
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,560
perfect life.

89
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:37,480
Maybe they tried to show us

90
00:06:38,280 --> 00:06:39,691
in such a cruel way

91
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:42,240
what is truly worth cherishing.

92
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,400
Then does the price

93
00:06:47,354 --> 00:06:48,882
have to be Ye Shen?

94
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,687
It's not that Ye Shen is the price.

95
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,640
It's the perfection

96
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:56,909
that requires a price.

97
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,720
Our teacher asked me
to give this to you.

98
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:10,720
They found it while sorting
through Ye Shen's belongings.

99
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:12,960
Once you read this,

100
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:14,960
you'll understand everything.

101
00:07:15,142 --> 00:07:16,991
(Shen)

102
00:07:26,406 --> 00:07:28,212
(Shen)

103
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,720
(September 1, sunny.)

104
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,360
(A new student joined.)

105
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,560
(Her name is)

106
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,790
(Gu Xiaotang.)

107
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,120
Xu Xingchen?

108
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:47,240
I'm Gu Xiaotang.

109
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,465
Here, this is for you.

110
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,520
(She's so lively)

111
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,360
(and warm,)

112
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,640
(though)

113
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,720
(a little bit noisy.)

114
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:09,800
(October 15, overcast.)

115
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,640
(She cried.)

116
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,880
(I wanted to comfort her)

117
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:20,560
(but didn't know what to say.)

118
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:29,840
(March 20, windy.)

119
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:33,000
(She said she wants to shine brightly.)

120
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:35,600
(I know she will.)

121
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,361
(I just)

122
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:40,200
(wonder who will be
standing by her side)

123
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,426
(when that day comes.)

124
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,240
(April 12,)

125
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,766
(sunny.)

126
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,640
(Her blood sugar drops easily,)

127
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:58,720
(so she always has
a lollipop in her mouth.)

128
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:12,720
(May 4, rainy.)

129
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,600
(She said)

130
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:16,480
(she wants a perfect life.)

131
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,465
Xiaotang,

132
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,200
you'll get the perfect life

133
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,400
you deserve.

134
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:25,080
Xiaotang,

135
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,280
you said you kept looping

136
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,760
for a perfect ending.

137
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,120
Is it perfect enough now?

138
00:09:36,067 --> 00:09:37,756
(She said she wants a perfect life.)

139
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,506
(Ye Shen,)

140
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,360
(I finally understand what you meant.)

141
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,840
(The scenery you quietly protected)

142
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,680
(has endured for so many years)

143
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,320
(without us realizing it.)

144
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,326
(Admission Notice)

145
00:10:09,920 --> 00:10:11,400
(Thank you for being there for me.)

146
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:13,580
(Now,)

147
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,360
(I'll remember the world)

148
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,720
(you didn't get to see for you.)

149
00:10:19,886 --> 00:10:21,640
(I'll walk the future
you couldn't live,)

150
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,600
(step by step, for you.)

151
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,861
(Look,)

152
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:49,680
(this is the perfect life
you helped achieve for me.)

153
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:51,920
(It's dazzling)

154
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,000
(and beautiful.)

155
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:56,960
Xiaotang.

156
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:59,248
What is it?

157
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,680
I like you.

158
00:11:11,602 --> 00:11:14,061
(Seven years later)

159
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:16,904
Thank you.

160
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,093
Xiaotang.

161
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,728
Why are you here?

162
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,720
What did your mom's report say?

163
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,600
She's fine, doing great.

164
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,826
Just needs regular checkups.

165
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:31,040
I hired a new assistant for you.

166
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,360
His name is funny.

167
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:33,880
Guess what it is?

168
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,987
What?

169
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,440
It's Mei.

170
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,600
Funny, right?

171
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,560
Look at us now.

172
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,360
Your career is booming.

173
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,560
Your mom is healthy.

174
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:49,080
And after Ms. Lei got out,

175
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,320
her business went legit and is thriving.

176
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,040
If only Ye Shen were here,

177
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:57,800
life would be absolutely perfect.

178
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,600
Look at me, saying too much.

179
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:09,320
I never think before I speak.

180
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,880
I didn't mean to bring it up.

181
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,160
It's fine.

182
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,480
An absolutely perfect life

183
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,840
might be just a dream.

184
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:24,520
Did you forget?

185
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,600
Ms. Lei invited us for hot pot.

186
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,800
It's almost time.

187
00:12:29,560 --> 00:12:30,840
Come on, let's go.

188
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,880
(What a coincidence.)

189
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:03,400
(Today was the day
I entered my very first loop.)

190
00:13:15,075 --> 00:13:16,480
(Except for the people,)

191
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:18,880
(nothing here has changed.)

192
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,760
(Up ahead is the hotel
where I had my wedding.)

193
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,240
(All of this)

194
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,440
(really feels like a dream.)

195
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,173
(This is)

196
00:13:57,760 --> 00:13:59,440
(where the loops began.)

197
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:08,040
(I wonder if it still
looks the same inside.)

198
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,120
Are you alone too?

199
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:58,680
You're so close,

200
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,459
yet in different bottles.

201
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:19,960
(What's going on?)

202
00:15:43,621 --> 00:15:45,240
(What...)

203
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,913
(Is everything starting over again?)

204
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:58,080
Xiaotang, what took you so long?

205
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,360
The ceremony is about to start.

206
00:16:03,553 --> 00:16:04,800
- Xiaotang!
- Xiaotang!

207
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,400
- Congratulations!
- Xiaotang!

208
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:10,200
Congratulations! Congratulations!

209
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,240
Come on, let's go.

210
00:18:26,573 --> 00:18:29,929
♪The face deep in the heart♪

211
00:18:30,121 --> 00:18:32,583
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

212
00:18:33,958 --> 00:18:37,658
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

213
00:18:37,869 --> 00:18:40,309
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

214
00:18:40,456 --> 00:18:42,828
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

215
00:18:42,978 --> 00:18:45,735
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

216
00:18:45,735 --> 00:18:48,056
♪Even for just a second♪

217
00:18:49,401 --> 00:18:52,864
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

218
00:18:52,992 --> 00:18:54,841
♪And sunlight reverses♪

219
00:18:54,841 --> 00:18:58,311
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

220
00:18:58,667 --> 00:19:00,741
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

221
00:19:01,243 --> 00:19:04,652
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

222
00:19:04,909 --> 00:19:10,121
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

223
00:19:11,375 --> 00:19:13,940
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

224
00:19:13,982 --> 00:19:17,435
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

225
00:19:18,012 --> 00:19:20,975
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

226
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:24,328
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

227
00:19:24,328 --> 00:19:27,951
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

228
00:19:28,421 --> 00:19:32,477
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
